  "content": "<div class=\"blog-content\">\n\n<h2>Watch: Ring Promoter quick intro (5 min)</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/SjXwaTVuYhM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/img/ring-promoter-youtube-thumbnail-v2.png?v=20260901b\" alt=\"Ring Promoter — AI-assisted promotion to production (5-minute intro)\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;\" /></a></p>\n<div style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;margin:1.25rem 0;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SjXwaTVuYhM\" title=\"Ring Promoter quick intro (5 min)\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#64748b;\">5-minute intro: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/SjXwaTVuYhM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtu.be/SjXwaTVuYhM</a> · Product: <a href=\"https://www.ringpromoter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ringpromoter.com</a></p>\n\n<p class=\"lead\"><em><strong>Ring Promoter</strong>是您在人工智能驱动的部署中不容错过的现代 CI/CD 控制平面 - 订购环<code>int → test → acc → prod</code>、健康门控升级、版本验证检查和自动回滚。产品：<a href=\"/zh/ring-promoter\">/环启动器</a>。深入探讨：<a href=\"/zh/articles/ring-promoter-modern-cicd-ai-powered-deployments\">长文</a>。站点：<a href=\"https://www.ringpromoter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ringpromoter.com</a>。</em></p><p><img src=\"/img/ring-promoter-cover.svg\" alt=\"Ring Promoter — modern CI/CD for AI-powered deployments\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;\" /></p><div style=\"background:#ecfdf5;border-left:4px solid #22c55e;border-radius:10px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0;\"><strong>底线。</strong>每个版本都会获得生产。 Ring Promoter 通过具有实时运行状况门的共享环来提升许多应用程序的版本 - 永远不会跳过环 - 并在目标保持不健康状态时自动回滚。专为在同一协议上交付 AI 平台、代理、API 和经典服务的团队而构建。开源 — 明星<a href=\"https://github.com/bwalia/ring-promoter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com/bwalia/ring-promoter</a>。</div><h2>观看：Ring Promoter 演示</h2><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/IzhvmrwEebE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/img/ring-promoter-youtube-thumbnail.png?v=20260901\" alt=\"Ring Promoter — Every release earns production (YouTube demo)\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;\" /></a></p><div style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;margin:1.25rem 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IzhvmrwEebE\" title=\"Ring Promoter — Every release earns production\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#64748b;\">TenthMatrix 演示：<a href=\"https://youtu.be/IzhvmrwEebE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtu.be/IzhvmrwEebE</a>· 产品：<a href=\"https://www.ringpromoter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ringpromoter.com</a></p><h2>环 — 永不跳过一跳</h2><p><img src=\"/img/ring-promoter-rings-flow.svg\" alt=\"Ring Promoter deployment rings int test acc prod with health gates\" width=\"1200\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;margin:1rem 0;\" /></p><ul><li><strong>int</strong>— 集成：首次登陆新版本和 AI/API 更改。</li><li><strong>测试</strong>— 测试：自动化和 QA 验证、评估套件、负载烟雾。</li><li><strong>acc</strong>— 验收：在客户之前进行业务/登台。</li><li><strong>产品</strong>— 生产：唯一为客户服务的环。</li></ul><h2>为什么人工智能团队需要它</h2><p>模型权重、代理运行时间、MCP 网关和推理 sidecar 以不同的节奏提供。当旧版本仍然回答 200 时，普通的“绿色运行状况检查”可能会撒谎。Ring Promoter 的可选<strong>版本验证运行状况</strong>要求端点报告刚刚部署的确切版本，否则自动回滚将启动。自动升级可能会在人类保持生产大门的情况下加快早期响铃。</p><h2>部署器 — 一个控制平面，多个后端</h2><p><img src=\"/img/ring-promoter-deployers.svg\" alt=\"Ring Promoter deployers kubectl GitHub Actions k8sjob\" width=\"1200\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;margin:1rem 0;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" /></p><ul><li><strong>KubectlDeployer</strong>—<code>set image</code>+ Kubernetes 推理、代理和 API 的推出状态。</li><li><strong>GitHubActionsDeployer</strong>— VM/CI 应用程序的工作流程调度（重用现有管道，例如 Proxy10x）。</li><li><strong>k8sjob</strong>— 具有实时日志和退出代码成功的运行程序作业。</li></ul><h2>相关 CI/CD 讲座</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;margin:1rem 0;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#0b1c2c;color:#86efac;\"><th style=\"padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #334155;\">谈话</th><th style=\"padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #334155;\">YouTube</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\"><strong>Ring Promoter — 每个版本都会投入生产（TenthMatrix 演示）</strong></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IzhvmrwEebE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtu.be/IzhvmrwEebE</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">通过 Argo CD ApplicationSets 进行免点击环境促销</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0PqzfNPp2VM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtu.be/0PqzfNPp2VM</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Adobe：使用 GitOps</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AD3isYT6M1c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">自动升级和回滚 youtu.be/AD3isYT6M1c</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">具有 Argo CD</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lN-G9TV9Ty0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">的环境之间的促销 youtu.be/lN-G9TV9Ty0</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">KubePilot — 使用 AI (TenthMatrix) 对 Kubernetes 进行故障排除</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CsiJWpfncqA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtu.be/CsiJWpfncqA</a></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>从 CI 集成到</h2>中<pre style=\"background:#0b1220;color:#e2e8f0;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;overflow:auto;font-size:0.85rem;\">\n# seed int, then promote up the pipeline\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -X POST \\\n  -d '{\"ring\":\"int\",\"version\":\"1.4.2\"}' $BASE/api/apps/web-frontend/seed\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -X POST \\\n  -d '{\"from_ring\":\"int\"}' $BASE/api/apps/web-frontend/promote\n# non-2xx = failed promotion (target auto-rolled back)\n</pre><p>CI 构建和测试； Ring Promoter 通过您的环境移动 CI 生成的内容。 非 2xx 响应意味着升级失败 —<code>curl --fail</code>就是您所需的全部集成。</p><h2>从哪里开始</h2><ol><li>打开<a href=\"https://www.ringpromoter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ringpromoter.com/</a>。</li><li>克隆<a href=\"https://github.com/bwalia/ring-promoter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com/bwalia/ring-promoter</a>。</li><li>阅读<a href=\"/zh/articles/ring-promoter-modern-cicd-ai-powered-deployments\">技术文章</a>或<a href=\"/zh/ring-promoter\">产品页面</a>。</li></ol><div style=\"background:#f0fdf4;border-left:4px solid #22c55e;border-radius:10px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0;\"><strong>标签。</strong>#CICD #DevOps #GitOps #Kubernetes #AI #PlatformEngineering #RingPromoter #OpenSource</div><p>由<a href=\"https://www.tenthmatrix.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TenthMatrix</a>发布。</p><p style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;\"><strong>产品站点：</strong><a href=\"https://www.ringpromoter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ringpromoter.com/</a></p></div>",
